WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.080
Breaking now, President Donald J. Trump has announced a historic new health care system,

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:10.680
the launch of America's first medbed hospitals and a national medbed card for every citizen.

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:17.240
Every American will soon receive their own medbed card. With it, you'll have guaranteed access to

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:23.560
our new hospitals led by the top doctors in the nation, equipped with the most advanced technology

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:30.400
in the world. These facilities are safe, modern, and designed to restore every citizen to full

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:36.140
health and strength. This is the beginning of a new era in American health care. In this first

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:42.000
phase, only a limited number of med bed cards will be released. Registration details will be announced

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:42.820
very soon.
